Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Scheme name: Arroz con Dulce
; Scheme system: base16
; Scheme description: Coconut cream, rice, cinnamon, clove, toasted sugar, and raisin tones inspired by Puerto Rican arroz con dulce.
; Scheme author: Richard Martinez
; Template author: Tinted Theming (https://github.com/tinted-theming)
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\SimonTatham\PuTTY\Sessions\base16-arroz-con-dulce]

